# Redirects that Workers static assets answer. These paths never reach the
# Worker (see run_worker_first in worker/wrangler.jsonc).

# The search index moved to a .json name so that it is served as
# application/json and compressed. Old tabs still ask for the old path.
/api/search /api/search.json 301

# The demo GIF (15.9 MB) is the one in the tuios README. Outside pages may
# still link to the copy this site used to serve. jsDelivr serves it as
# image/gif; raw.githubusercontent.com sends application/octet-stream, so a
# browser would download it instead of showing it.
/demo.gif https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Gaurav-Gosain/tuios@main/assets/demo.gif 301
